message: "If you use OrchLang, cite this research software and the accompanying technical report."
title: "OrchLang: Replayable Contracts for Token Usage and Request-Equivalent LLM Workflows"
type: software
version: "0.5.0-rc1"
date-released: "2026-10-09"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/guyoverclocked/orchlang-compiler-design-project"
authors:
