abstract: "An offline C++17 compiler and Python analysis tools for conditional token accounting, request-equivalent LLM workflows, exact finite usage channels, sufficient stochastic bisimulation, and exact all-finite-horizon trace-law equivalence, with independent certificate and finite-witness replay and restricted LangGraph source integration."
keywords:
  - static analysis
  - relational cost
  - LLM orchestration
  - compiler
  - quantitative information flow
  - probabilistic bisimulation
